ecretory granule formation at the Golgi of pancreatic beta cells (PubMed:22981988)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}